{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-28T14:12:49.271Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"39f0409326ff3a93bdf4de17","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-kxmu54","lineage:pm-kxmu54","lineage:pm-5oj5","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"pm-kxmu54","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-kxmu54","lineage:pm-kxmu54","lineage:pm-5oj5","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.332","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-28T14:12:49.271Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-11-28T14:12:49.271Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Implementation note (2026-11-28): after the pm-usn5k2 partition, excludeTestOnlyRegressions judges every remaining issue whose substatus is regressed. It reads the issue's activity (GET /organizations/{org}/issues/{id}/), takes the latest set_resolved* entry, then lists non-test events since then (GET .../issues/{id}/events/?query=!environment:test !pm.source_context:test&start=<resolution>&end=<now>&per_page=1). An empty list moves the issue to test_only and reports it under ignored_test_only_regression_short_ids. It fails closed when the activity has no resolution, when the details or events request is not OK or throws, when the body is empty or not a list, and when the listing came through the sentry CLI with no API token. Live API probe on PM-CLI-42: the activity shows set_resolved 13:27:21Z and set_regression 13:39:40Z, the non-test event list since 13:30Z holds 0 events and the one since 11-27 holds 1 (the automation event), so the rule would have skipped today's test-only regression. A live gate run against the project now reports ok with ignored_test_only_regression_short_ids []. PM-CLI-42 is archived until 02:59Z, so it is not listed."}]}],"before_hash":"bae0fa2be06f52fc8984c6076f82af2f98581cad332918c2350f9f110d62c4a6","after_hash":"92ee115cf0de8c6ebde119173362c7c6630d33fc5e478f6cc0f2bca999c518ba","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"e0a8604b9b579caefe106177480e3c749dfa819b2b80b51550566f487ba377c6"}
