pped. The other 9 (real regression, no resolution, malformed activity, details 500, events 500, events throw, non-list body, empty body, ongoing) block, and a CLI listing keeps blocking with no fetch. The live API probe confirms the queries return 0 since today's resolution and 1 before it, and 76 gate tests pass with 100% coverage of the changed lines"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/close_reason","value":"A resolved issue that regressed only through test events no longer blocks the release gate"}],"before_hash":"c97d3d96d40798a9d904fbd984559ff62b12db10c86c9501e0d695eda7914cff","after_hash":"507109152012be962e13a2c59cfb456a02c495271d95020a805ea87ffe2f45f9","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"completion":{"timestamp":"2026-11-28T14:12:51.089Z","source":"close_time"},"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"6d22ae4678f7169bd2db913b2648a68324d7d236a4b897fd730f187016e9e6ee"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-28T14:12:51.798Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"39f0409326ff3a93bdf4de17","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-kxmu54","lineage:pm-kxmu54","lineage:pm-5oj5","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"pm-kxmu54","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-kxmu54","lineage:pm-kxmu54","lineage:pm-5oj5","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.332","source":"probe"}},"op":"release","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-28T14:12:51.798Z"}],"before_hash":"507109152012be962e13a2c59cfb456a02c495271d95020a805ea87ffe2f45f9","after_hash":"4b76b8e544f5f60fbc7635809b49c9bd4e14e16d0038d4cb4c462a6d7b318699","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"maintenance","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"5eccb63241a85aa09aa922d7c91f14538c0d4618e3eed1f5d45dba42ba42124d"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-28T14:45:15.381Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"39f0409326ff3a93bdf4de17","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-928ng6","lineage:pm-928ng6","lineage:pm-u9d0","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"pm-928ng6","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-928ng6","lineage:pm-928ng6","lineage:pm-u9d0","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.332","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-28T14:45:15.380Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Codex review round 1, gpt-6.2-sol xhigh, 2026-11-28. Both findings were valid and are fixed. P1: a production event timestamped ahead of the gate's clock could mark the issue regressed yet fall after the event query's end, so an empty list was not proof. The gate now reads the set_regression activity's data.event_id and requires that triggering event itself to be test traffic (environment or pm.source_context test). The window starts at the earlier of the resolution and the trigger, and ends 10 minutes past max(now, trigger, issue lastSeen). P2: Promise.all fired one issue-details request per regression, against Sentry's 5 GETs per second per organization. Lookups now run one at a time within one budget, and a 429 is retried up to 3 times after its Retry-After (1 s when absent or invalid) unless that would pass the budget. Each of these failure modes keeps the issue blocking. The spec has 19 fixture issues, covering throttled retries, an exhausted throttle, a Retry-After past the budget and a 429 with no header."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-28T14:45:15.381Z"}],"before_hash":"4b76b8e544f5f60fbc7635809b49c9bd4e14e16d0038d4cb4c462a6d7b318699","after_hash":"2bd4cdf7d89a103e66b23c3923a09f2bed0b4a4a6e608150de7d9df303464499","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"05442d525190c72ad358186b482fca4c1662a09e770931462eeee1e1d4cff656"}
